    "subtitle": "인쇄술 혁명: 구텐베르크 금속활자와 지식의 대중화",
    "summary": "Around 1450 in Mainz, Germany, Johannes Gutenberg combined movable metal type, oil-based ink, and a screw press to create mass book production.",
