    "subtitle": "기계를 위한 윤리: 자율주행차의 트롤리 딜레마와 인공지능",
    "summary": "Philippa Foot's classic 'Trolley Problem' has migrated from philosophical thought experiment into algorithmic code. Autonomous vehicles force computer scientists to program moral trade-offs between passenger survival and pedestrian safety.",
    "coverImage": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1451187580459-43490279c0fa?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80",
