    "summary": "Brain-Computer Interfaces (BCIs) translate neural electrical spikes into digital commands. Pioneered by Philip Kennedy and Elon Musk's Neuralink, BCIs enable paralyzed patients to control prosthetic limbs and computers with thought.",
