      "text": "Brain-Computer Interfaces (BCIs) translate neural electrical spikes into digital commands. Pioneered by Philip Kennedy and Elon Musk's Neuralink, BCIs enable paralyzed patients to control prosthetic limbs and computers with thought.",
      "question": "Why is understanding Bionic Humans: Brain-Computer Interfaces (BCI) essential to history and modern thinking?",
      "background": "Brain-Computer Interfaces (BCIs) translate neural electrical spikes into digital commands. Pioneered by Philip Kennedy and Elon Musk's Neuralink, BCIs enable paralyzed patients to control prosthetic limbs and computers with thought."
